      "params": {
        "text": "Polygons from a spread\n\n`draw/polygon` consumes a Spread<vec2> as one shape (not N shapes — no ForEach needed). Use it whenever you want a single outline that connects the dots.\n\nA Fibonacci sunflower drawn as one closed polygon.",
        "width": 380,
        "height": 220
      },
      "portValues": {
